                                                "sense_id": "5647df44-1981-3795-a88c-a81d8cc521d7",
                                                "text": "SWR has more than its fair share of major national events. As well as the [Queen's] funeral and the coronation in the past 12 months, annual events include racing at Ascot, grand slam tennis at Wimbledon, and rugby internationals at Twickenham."
